---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="San Francisco Car Accidents Lawyer | Sulfab Law Office"
  description="Injured in a car accident in San Francisco? Sulfab Law Office helps with medical bills, lost wages & vehicle damage. Call (415) 360-5266 for a free case review."
>
  <section class="relative bg-dark pt-28 pb-32 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-dark via-dark to-slate-900/80"></div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full mb-8"></div>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Personal Injury</span>
        <h1 class="text-white text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-6">San Francisco Car Accidents Lawyer</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xl md:text-2xl max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-10">The post-crash period can be a troublesome time for many people. On one hand, you are in the hospital with injuries, and doctors are treating you. On the other hand, you may be worried about medical bills, missed work, vehicle damage and what to do next. These concerns can make an already stressful situation even harder.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-gold text-white font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all rounded-lg">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
          <a href="/#contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 border-2 border-white/25 text-white hover:border-gold hover:bg-white/5 transition-all rounded-lg">Free Case Review</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-slate-50/50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">In this situation, you can rely on car accidents lawyers in San Francisco to give you legal guidance in your case, helping you get the compensation you deserve. Sulfab Law Office supports injured people in San Francisco and the Bay Area region. We will take care of the legal matters, allowing you to concentrate on recovering.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed font-semibold">Call <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="text-gold hover:underline">(415) 360-5266</a> for a free case review.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 border-t border-slate-100 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[5fr_7fr] gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Our Approach</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">How We Help After a Car Accident</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Each accident is different, and each one needs its specific approach. While some people need only several weeks to fully recover from injuries, some other people might need several months, or even years. Our lawyers pay attention to each case personally, ensuring we get all the evidence to prove our claims. Such evidence includes, but is not limited to:</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-6">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-700"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gold shrink-0"></span> Police reports</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-700"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gold shrink-0"></span> Eyewitnesses</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-700"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gold shrink-0"></span> Medical reports</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="mt-8 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-gold/20">
            <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium">Also, we coordinate all communications with insurance companies, negotiate fair compensation for you, and represent you in court, if needed.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Common Causes</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Common Causes of Car Accidents</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto">There are various reasons for crashes, but most of them occur due to the negligent behavior of drivers. Determination of the actual or real cause helps to prove who is responsible. Typical cases investigated by car accident lawyers in San Francisco include:</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Driving distracted</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Texting while driving</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Speeding</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Drunk or impaired driving</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Tailgating</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Unsafe lane change</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Fatigued driving</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Failure to yield</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center text-slate-500 text-sm mt-8 italic">Just one moment of carelessness can result in severe injuries.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Common Injuries</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Injuries We Commonly See</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto">Car accidents can cause various kinds of injuries that affect the body's functioning in various ways. Some injuries show their signs right away, while some might only show their first sign days later.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Whiplash and Neck Pain</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">A sudden impact can strain the muscles and ligaments in your neck. You could experience stiffness, headaches, and pain.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Back and Spinal Injuries</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Spine or back injuries can affect the body's functionality and might require surgery to be able to regain some or all of the functions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Brain Injuries</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Brain injuries range from relatively simple to extremely serious, and both types can come with a long list of unpleasant side effects. A head injury can lead to memory loss, focus issues, and other complications.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Broken Bones and Internal Injuries</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">These injuries are also serious and should be taken care of immediately after an accident or a crash.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Financial Recovery</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">What Compensation Can You Recover?</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">If another driver's negligence caused your injuries, then you could potentially be entitled to financial compensation. An experienced car accident attorney in San Francisco can help you identify and calculate both current and future losses. You may recover payment for:</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2 text-sm">Medical bills and hospital costs</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 1.5-4.5 1.5S9 3 7.5 3A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2 text-sm">Surgery and rehabilitative care</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="9" y="2" width="6" height="20" rx="1"/><path d="M9 8h6M9 12h6M9 16h6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2 text-sm">Prescription medication</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2 text-sm">Loss of earning capacity</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2 text-sm">Lost income</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2 text-sm">Pain and suffering</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100 md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-3 max-w-sm mx-auto w-full">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 1.5-4.5 1.5S9 3 7.5 3A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2 text-sm">Emotional distress</h3>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center text-slate-500 text-sm mt-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">The value of each of these compensations will be determined based upon the circumstances of your accident and the severity of your injuries.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 text-center">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Why Choose Us</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Why Select Sulfab Law Office</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">When it comes to selecting a car accident lawyer who will represent you and handle your claim, it is important to choose wisely. We believe that every client deserves personal attention, honest advice and strong legal support for these kinds of cases. When you work with us, you receive:</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-left max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50/50 border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 text-gold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">✓</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">A comprehensive review of your case</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50/50 border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 text-gold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">✓</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Communication with our legal team directly</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50/50 border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 text-gold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">✓</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Strong negotiations with the insurance company</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50/50 border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 text-gold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">✓</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Comprehensive and dedicated representation</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mt-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">We understand that you need someone to stand up for you and fight for what you deserve, so that you can move on with your life.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-dark border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4 italic font-serif">Searching for a San Francisco Car Accident Lawyer? Call Us</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg mb-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">It is important to contact a car accident attorney soon after an accident since valuable evidence may be lost and insurance companies may try to settle with you on their terms.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Call now for a legal consultation with a car accident attorney in San Francisco. Sulfab Law Office will consider your case, provide you with all necessary information, and assist in receiving appropriate compensation.</p>
      <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-gold text-white font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all rounded-lg">Call (415) 360-5266 today for your free consultation</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Questions & Answers</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">FAQ</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="border border-slate-100 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-50/50">
          <button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left font-bold text-dark faq-toggle" onclick="this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('hidden'); this.querySelector('svg').classList.toggle('rotate-180')">
            <span>In California, what is the deadline for filing a car accident lawsuit?</span>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold shrink-0 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Most injury claims must be filed within two years of the accident, and claims against a government agency may have a shorter deadline of six months.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-slate-100 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-50/50">
          <button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left font-bold text-dark faq-toggle" onclick="this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('hidden'); this.querySelector('svg').classList.toggle('rotate-180')">
            <span>Can you still recover compensation after being partially responsible for the accident?</span>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold shrink-0 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Yes. California employs a system of comparative negligence. You may receive a smaller amount of compensation due to your share of fault in the accident.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-slate-100 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-50/50">
          <button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left font-bold text-dark faq-toggle" onclick="this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('hidden'); this.querySelector('svg').classList.toggle('rotate-180')">
            <span>What should I do if I get a call from an insurance company?</span>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold shrink-0 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Do not give any statements or sign anything unless you have consulted with an attorney. Insurance companies may use your words to reduce your claim.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-slate-100 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-50/50">
          <button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left font-bold text-dark faq-toggle" onclick="this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('hidden'); this.querySelector('svg').classList.toggle('rotate-180')">
            <span>What happens if the other driver was not insured?</span>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold shrink-0 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            If you have uninsured or underinsured motorist coverage, it may be available under your policy.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
